title Code: environment repo, delivery folders and their writers (§6.1, §6.2; git ls-files, 2026-09-24)

*:<b>basic-environment-octopus-codefresh/</b>
private; branch main takes pull requests with
CODEOWNERS review and codefresh/env-checks; <<root>>
**:<b>apps/</b>
one descriptor per app
<size:11>read by <color:$C_ARGO>Argo CD</color>, <color:$C_OCTOPUS>Octopus</color> apps-apply,</size>
<size:11><color:$C_AZURE>Terraform</color> and the kit</size>;
***:<b>schema.json</b>
JSON Schema 2020-12;
***:<b><app>.yaml</b>
workorders, sandbox; <<app>>
**:<b>codefresh/</b>
<size:11>read by <color:$C_CODEFRESH>Codefresh</color> from main</size>;
***:<b>register.sh</b>
modes ~--preview, ~--full, ~--app;
***:<b>runner/values.yaml</b>
cf-runtime chart;
***:<b>platform/</b>
pipelines, specs, scripts:
platform-env/*;
***:<b>templates/</b>
minimal, multi-image,
dotnet-buildps1;
***:<b>apps/<app>/</b>
pipelines, specs, scripts; <<app>>
**:<b>containers/</b>
<size:11>read by <color:$C_CODEFRESH>Codefresh</color> builds</size>;
***:<b>platform/</b>
ci-dotnet, db-tools-mssql;
***:<b>apps/<app>/<image>/</b>
Dockerfile per image; <<app>>
**:<b>.octopus/</b>
config as code
<size:11>read by <color:$C_OCTOPUS>Octopus</color></size>; <<obranch>>
***:<b>platform-infrastructure/</b>
runbooks env-*, apps-*,
env-wake, env-sleep
<size:10>variables.ocl: security owners</size>; <<obranch>>
***:<b>platform-wake/</b>
security owners; <<obranch>><<sec>>
***:<b>apps/<app>/<project>/</b>
process, variables, runbooks; <<app>>
**:<b>octopus/</b>
<size:11>run by the operator</size>;
***:<b>terraform/</b>
space objects; for_each
over apps/*.yaml
<size:10>library-variable-sets.tf:</size>
<size:10>security owners</size>;
***:<b>apply.sh</b>
plan and apply;
***:<b>templates/</b>
deploy-minimal,
deploy-with-db, db-runbooks;
***:<b>step-templates/</b>
sod-guard, db-backup,
pin-writer;
**:<b>argocd/</b>
<size:11>read by <color:$C_ARGO>Argo CD</color>;</size>
<size:11>bootstrap/ also by <color:$C_AZURE>terraform/tier</color></size>;
***:<b>bootstrap/</b>
values-<tier>,
root-app-<tier>;
***:<b>clusters/<tier>/</b>
appset-apps, namespaces,
projects, storage, secrets;
***:<b>clusters/<tier>/addons/</b>
seven add-on Applications;
***:<b>optional/</b>
argo-rollouts (phase 6);
**:<b>gitops/</b>
<size:11>read by <color:$C_ARGO>Argo CD</color></size>;
***:<b>platform/tenant/</b>
tenant chart
<size:10>signer policy: security owners</size>;
***:<b>platform/components/</b>
db, db-credentials, backup;
***:<b>platform/ingress/</b>
Gateway, ClusterIssuers;
***:<b>templates/</b>
kustomize, helm, raw;
***:<b>apps/<app>/</b>
<deployable>/base/,
components/, previews/; <<app>>
****:<b>envs/<env>/<deployable>/</b>
Octopus pin commits:
image tags only; <<pin>>
****:<b>envs/<env>/db/</b>
database of each environment; <<app>>
**:<b>policies/</b>
<size:11>read by <color:$C_ARGO>Argo CD</color></size>; <<sec>>
***:<b>kyverno/</b>
base, overlays/<tier>, tests; <<sec>>
***:<b>octopus/</b>
guardrails, inactive; <<sec>>

legend right
  <b>Writers</b>
  <back:#FFFFFF> white </back> people only, by pull request
  <back:#E8F1FA> light blue </back> app-scoped path: scaffolded once, then the app's own
  <back:#EFEBF7> light purple </back> also Octopus: UI edits on branches, and one
  "Converting project to use VCS" commit per project on main
  <back:$C_OCTOPUS><color:#FFFFFF> purple </color></back> Octopus commits to main: image tags only
  <color:$C_DANGER><b>red border</b></color> security owners approve
  Codefresh and Argo CD never write here; Codefresh posts commit statuses.
endlegend

@endwbs
